config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_094_FB_TEST
	bool "Contest 2026 team 094 framebuffer test"
	default n
	depends on VIDEO_FB && FB_UPDATE
	---help---
		Enable the fb_test NSH command. It validates /dev/fb0 and draws an
		RGB565 color-bar pattern on the demo88-nor 1024x600 LVDS panel.
